  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Number of elements in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Number of subsets<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></math></p><p>Number of subsets having less than&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;elements&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Number of subsets having at least&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;elements<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>219</mn></math></p>",
